# 🚀 Control-M Agent Deployment with GitLab CI + Ansible

This repository automates the installation and configuration of **Control-M Agents** on **RHEL** (and later Windows) servers using **Ansible**, orchestrated by **GitLab CI/CD**.

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```text
controlm-deploy/
├── .gitlab-ci.yml                # GitLab pipeline definition
├── README.md                     # Documentation (this file)
├── ansible/
│   ├── deploy_controlm.yml        # Main playbook
│   ├── inventory/
│   │   └── hosts.yml             # Target host definitions
│   ├── group_vars/
│   │   └── all.yml               # Global variables (if any)
│   ├── roles/
│   │   └── controlm_agent/
│   │       ├── tasks/
│   │       │   ├── main.yml      # OS detection and include
│   │       │   ├── linux.yml     # RHEL deployment tasks
│   │       │   └── windows.yml   # Windows deployment tasks (future)
│   │       ├── templates/
│   │       │   └── agent_config.j2
│   │       └── vars/
│   │           └── main.yml
